                <pb facs="0176" n="68" sameAs="frus:frus1927v02/pg68"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/8175: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-02-01T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 1,
                                1927—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>41. Your telegram [105], February 1, 10 p.m. Procedure outlined in paragraphs 1
                    and 2 is approved. I shall withhold publication here until you advise me that
                    message has been delivered. For publication Department will use text as amended
                    in its telegram 35, January 31, 1 p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
